<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Friday. There were no sales of slaughter steers confirmed and not enough heifers for a market test at the close Friday.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand were light. Sales confirmed on 200 salughter heifers. Last weeks confirmed sales a weekly record 136,400 head including 26,100 head or about 19 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle and CME delivery cattle.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1100 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed: 200    last week:  31200	 last year:  9600</p>
</text>
